      "properties": {
        "char_end": 760,
        "char_start": 684,
        "episode_id": "9a2d05c1-8854-5ae6-8ad0-14fcf37d1de9",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "I want to dig into that. What's the most underrated piece of marine biology?",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 42000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 36000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p03_e03.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:a82fee3e7f1af245",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 977,
        "char_start": 781,
        "episode_id": "9a2d05c1-8854-5ae6-8ad0-14fcf37d1de9",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Yeah, so \u2014 Reef-conservation policy is a systems problem at planetary scale. We've seen this play out at teams using GoPro. The framing matters because it tells you which trade-offs you're making.",
